### 缓存监控（各内存缓存的键数量与读写统计）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 缓存列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/list?pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 缓存列表（按缓存名称过滤）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/list?cacheName=captcha
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 缓存列表（按缓存键模糊过滤）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/list?cacheKey=zzz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 缓存列表（缓存名称不存在）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/list?cacheName=not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清空指定缓存
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/clear?cacheName=captcha
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清空全部缓存
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 清空缓存（缓存名称不存在）
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/cache/clear?cacheName=not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 期望响应结构
# /monitor/cache
# {
#   "code": 0,
#   "msg": "success",
#   "data": {
#     "info": [
#       { "name": "captcha", "keyCount": 2, "hits": 5, "misses": 1, "sets": 6, "deletes": 0,
#         "expired": 3, "cleanupInterval": "2m0s", "createdAt": "2024-01-01 00:00:00", "uptime": "12分钟" },
#       { "name": "default", "keyCount": 0, "hits": 0, "misses": 0, "sets": 0, "deletes": 0,
#         "expired": 0, "cleanupInterval": "1m0s", "createdAt": "2024-01-01 00:00:00", "uptime": "12分钟" }
#     ],
#     "dbSize": 2,
#     "commandStats": [ { "name": "get", "value": 5 }, { "name": "miss", "value": 1 },
#                       { "name": "set", "value": 6 }, { "name": "del", "value": 0 } ],
#     "names": [ "captcha", "default" ]
#   }
# }
#
# /monitor/cache/list
# { "code": 0, "msg": "success",
#   "data": { "list": [ { "cacheName": "captcha", "cacheKey": "captcha:xxx", "cacheValue": "1234",
#                         "expiration": "2024-01-01 00:05:00" } ], "total": 1, "page": 1, "pageSize": 10 } }
#
# 说明：
# - 本项目使用进程内内存缓存（common/cache），与若依基于 Redis 的实现不同，因此统计的是各内存缓存实例
# - 已注册的缓存：default（默认缓存）、captcha（图形验证码）
